634 0 obj
  << /ActualText (SOLE 1 \174 Director of Community \046 Marketing \174 Denver\054 CO \174 July 2025 \055 Present \nHelped build Sole 1 from its inception\054 partnering with the CEO to create the brand identity\054 creative direction\054 and social storytelling strategy ahead of launch\056\nConduct interviews with prospective users\054 physical therapists\054 and PT clinics to uncover real world challenges\054 audience insights\054 and compelling human stories\056\nTranslate firsthand conversations into authentic messaging\054 creative concepts\054 and a library of social ready content prepared for the company\047s launch\056\nLead community outreach and coordinate clinic partnerships\054 participant communications\054 and creative preparation for the upcoming winter testing phase\056\n\nMAIN STREET AUTO \174 Marketing Manager \174 Atlanta\054 GA \174 Jan 2025 \055 July 2025 \nLed creative direction and production of social\054 digital\054 and branded content across 95\053 locations\054 adapting creative for different audiences while maintaining a consistent brand voice\056\nTranslated marketing objectives into actionable creative briefs\054 guiding a design team from initial concepts through final campaign assets\056\nDirected high visibility creative for the company\047s NASCAR sponsorship\054 bringing brand storytelling to life through large scale campaign visuals and trackside experiences\056\n\nMAIN STREET AUTO \174 Marketing Specialist \174 Atlanta\054 GA \174 Jan 2024 \055 Jan 2025 \nLaunched and independently managed the company\047s first centralized organic social presence across Instagram\054 Facebook\054 YouTube\054 and LinkedIn\056\nServed as the sole in\055house creative\054 owning the entire content production process from concept development and content calendars to photography\054 videography\054 editing\054 graphic design\054 and publishing\056\nLed rebrand from Northern Rock to Main Street Auto\054 developing a cohesive visual identity and original creative assets across social\054 digital\054 and print\056\n\nDAVID YURMAN \174 Creative Concept \046 Strategy Lead \050Contract\051 \174 Savannah\054 GA \174 Mar 2023 \205 Aug 2023\nLed a cross\055functional creative team in campaign concepting\054 storyboarding\054 and visual storytelling for David Yurman\047s global Holiday 2023 campaign\056\nCollaborated on XR\055stage production\054 helping translate creative concepts into compelling shots with attention to framing\054 visual impact\054 and adaptability across social and digital platforms\056\nDeveloped and pitched campaign concepts and creative presentations directly to David Yurman executive leadership\056\n\nLAKE PAJAMAS \174 Digital Design Intern \174 Savannah\054 GA \174 Sep 2022 \055 Feb 2023 \nAssisted with social content shoots and creative production\054 supporting on\055set preparation\054 visual styling\054 and the development of branded digital content\056\n\nSAVANNAH COLLEGE OF ART AND DESIGN \174 Savannah\054 GA \174 Sep 2018 \055 June 2023\nBachelor of Fine Arts\054 Advertising \046 Branding \174 Concentration in Art Direction \174 Cum Laude)
     /K [ 9 ]
     /P 635 0 R
     /Pg 617 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

